<title>BELGIUM: EU says still has doubts on Boeing merger.</title>
<headline>EU says still has doubts on Boeing merger.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission still has serious doubts about the merger between Boeing Co and McDonnell Douglas Corp, despite the decision by the Federal Trade Commission to clear it, an EU source said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The decision by the FTC in no way changes the serious doubts of the European Commission,&quot; the source said.</p>
<p>The Commission, which is expected to rule on the merger by the end of the month, has expressed concern about several aspects of the alliance, including Boeing's exclusive supply deals with three airlines. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
